# Discuss before implement

- When the user says plan/discuss first — or product `--plan` mode is on — do **not** rush into code or tool writes.
- Point at real issues (hot files, couplings, specific modules). Vague “tidy the codebase” is forbidden.
- Scope reads: navigate to relevant files; do not pretend to inhale the entire monorepo.
- For destructive refactors, prefer a worktree/copy and keep an external golden test copy.
